ments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nucoui/chatora/commits/b97daafe3af64b824ca013768325695d22401475/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-20T01:59:52Z","email":"kanekotakuma@team-lab.com","name":"takuma-ru"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-20T01:59:52Z","email":"kanekotakuma@team-lab.com","name":"takuma-ru"},"message":"feat: Implement genSD and related methods for optimized DOM manipulation and reactivity\n\n- Introduced `mount` function for creating DOM nodes from virtual nodes (vNode).\n- Added `patch` function for efficient DOM updates by comparing old and new vNodes.\n- Created `reactivity` module to expose reactive primitives like signal and computed.\n- Developed `style` and `styleObject` modules for handling CSS styles in DOM and Shadow DOM.\n- Implemented `hastToJsx` utility for converting HAST to ChatoraJSXElement.\n- Updated tests to reflect changes in method names and structure, ensuring coverage for new functionalities.\n- Defined types for `GenSD` and related components to enhance TypeScript support.","tree":{"sha":"dcd92c43d5c31d976dccda10bb3e1aedb594d0a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nucoui/chatora/git/trees/dcd92c43d5c31d976dccda10bb3e1aedb594d0a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nucoui/chatora/git/commits/b97daafe3af64b824ca013768325695d22401475","verification":{"payload":"tree dcd92c43d5c31d976dccda10bb3e1aedb594d0a3\nparent 537c8187a1bf9c1316310df75551b285e315d377\nauthor takuma-ru <kanekotakuma@team-lab.com> 1755655192 +0900\ncommitter takuma-ru <kanekotakuma@team-lab.com> 1755655192 +0900\n\nfeat: Implement genSD and related methods for optimized DOM manipulation and reactivity\n\n- Introduced `mount` function for creating DOM nodes from virtual nodes (vNode).\n- Added `patch` function for efficient DOM updates by comparing old and new vNodes.\n- Created `reactivity` module to expose reactive primitives like signal and computed.\n- Developed `style` and `styleObject` modules for handling CSS styles in DOM 