html_url":"https://github.com/ztng123","id":53010592,"login":"ztng123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDEwNTky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice/commits/cd1cfc9f721f947741ef869c8a7c3655e56f2914/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T18:19:02Z","email":"dpwl991102@gmail.com","name":"ztng123"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T18:19:02Z","email":"dpwl991102@gmail.com","name":"ztng123"},"message":"feat(chatbot): HR 메뉴 확장과 답변 바로가기·추천 팝업·표·복사 개선\n\n- HR 메뉴 24개 추가(근태·결재·인사신청·조회·설정)와 키워드 연결\n- 보낸 질문의 키워드로 답변 아래 \"HR 메뉴 바로가기\" 패널\n  (아이콘·이름·한 줄 설명, 최대 3개) — 메뉴마다 설명 추가\n- 입력 중 추천 팝업을 명령 팔레트 카드로: 반응 키워드 표시,\n  닫기 버튼, 질문 속 키워드 강조, ↑↓·Enter·Esc 선택,\n  질문 클릭 후 팝업이 다시 뜨던 문제 수정\n- 답변 표: 카드형, 숫자 열 오른쪽 정렬, 값 막대, 상태 알약,\n  주말 칩, 합계 줄, 7줄 넘으면 접기, 줄 차례 등장 애니메이션\n- 답변 복사 버튼(평문 변환, 표는 탭 구분)\n- 위쪽 막대 흰 바탕에 맞춰 챗봇 헤더 아이콘을 회색으로\n- 테스트용 jest 설정에 lucide-react CJS 연결\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3eb442b21315ac4357ffdbcb6a01e17196c7875a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice/git/trees/3eb442b21315ac4357ffdbcb6a01e17196c7875a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice/git/commits/cd1cfc9f721f947741ef869c8a7c3655e56f2914","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53010592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users