dpwl991102@gmail.com","name":"ztng123"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T08:02:50Z","email":"dpwl991102@gmail.com","name":"ztng123"},"message":"refactor(chatbot): HR 시각화 그래프를 recharts/커스텀 트리로 교체\n\n- 근무현황(막대)·급여추세(선): Chart.js canvas 직접 마운트 → recharts 선언적\n  렌더링. VizBlockRenderer의 useEffect/chartRef.destroy() 제거, React.lazy +\n  Suspense + 에러 바운더리로 3개 타입 공용 처리\n- 조직도: Mermaid SVG innerHTML 주입 → 순수 React 트리 컴포넌트\n  (charts/OrgChartTree.tsx) — hover 강조 인터랙션 추가, LLM이 만든 라벨을\n  DOM에 직접 꽂던 표면 제거\n- 근무현황 막대는 단색 대신 상태별 의미색 적용(정상=초록/지각·조퇴·출퇴근\n  누락=주황/결근=빨강, 그 외는 accent 폴백)\n- 급여추세 다중 시리즈는 표시명 대신 내부 키(s0/s1…)로 분리해 시리즈명\n  충돌(예: \"x\") 시 데이터가 깨지지 않도록 수정\n- package.json: chart.js/mermaid 제거, recharts 추가\n- 렌더 테스트(VizBlockRenderer.test.tsx) 신규 추가로 커버리지 확보\n\nteamplgpt viz JSON 계약은 불변 — 렌더러 내부 구현만 교체.","tree":{"sha":"5fac4db732eabfa27e1cb821829e2cda9da258f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice/git/trees/5fac4db732eabfa27e1cb821829e2cda9da258f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice/git/commits/316009b70f8d3f8f099eea7ab2fe3612725ab5b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53010592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ztng123","id":53010592,"login":"ztng123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDEwNTky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https