comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T06:08:09Z","email":"dpwl991102@gmail.com","name":"ztng123"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T06:08:09Z","email":"dpwl991102@gmail.com","name":"ztng123"},"message":"fix(tickets): 모바일 상세 팝업 note/activity 노출 및 댓글 UI 개선\n\n모바일에서 !isMobile 가드에 걸려 아예 렌더링되지 않던 내부메모(Note)와\n활동 로그(Activity)를 노출하고, 담당자 선택 영역보다 아래(맨 밑)에\n배치했다. 고객 위젯 댓글은 담당자/고객 구분 없이 동일한 모양의\n세로 블록으로만 쌓이던 것을 채팅 버블 형태로 바꿔, 담당자 댓글은\n오른쪽, 고객 댓글은 왼쪽으로 정렬되게 했다.\n\n- Left.tsx: buildActivityBlocks 헬퍼로 note/activity 렌더링을\n  분리하고 MobileNoteActivity를 export. 댓글 컨테이너/이름표에\n  isTeam을 전달해 좌우 정렬 및 말풍선 폭(82%)·모서리 스타일 적용\n- MobileLayout.tsx: MobileLayoutComponent에 bottomContent prop\n  추가 (sidebarContent 다음, 최하단에 배치)\n- TicketEditForm.tsx: bottomContent로 MobileNoteActivity 전달\n- ui-internalnotes/Form.tsx: 내부메모 입력 폼 버튼/에디터에\n  768px 이하 미디어쿼리로 터치 친화적 스타일 추가","tree":{"sha":"a7e688b963b0a2fd63e5ac8f352265f358cb6ece","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice/git/trees/a7e688b963b0a2fd63e5ac8f352265f358cb6ece"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice/git/commits/fd1bb01bdb3abe34a6cce7fbe7391cfcf73acddd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53010592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ztng123","id":53010592,"login":"ztng123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDEwNTky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng