54Z","email":"dpwl991102@gmail.com","name":"ztng123"},"message":"fix(core-ui): iOS Chrome 로그인 후 회색 화면 크래시 수정\n\nDetectBrowser가 iOS Chrome(CriOS)을 구형 Safari로 오판해\nuserAgent.split(\"Version/\")[1]가 undefined인 채로 split을 호출해\nTypeError를 던졌다. 로그인 화면(AuthLayout)에는 이 컴포넌트가 없고\n로그인 후 진입하는 MainLayout에서만 마운트되며, Routes를 감싸는\nErrorBoundary가 없어 render 중 예외로 React 트리 전체가\n언마운트되어 회색 화면으로 남았다.\n\n- CriOS/FxiOS를 Chrome/Safari 분기보다 먼저 판별하도록 순서 변경\n- UA 토큰이 없을 때 split 대신 경고를 건너뛰도록 방어 가드 추가\n- bootsrapOS.tsx/bootDiagnostics.ts: 최초 부팅 실패(렌더 예외, 초기\n  설정 조회 실패, 렌더 타임아웃) 시 순수 DOM 진단 화면을 띄워\n  원인 파악이 가능하도록 함","tree":{"sha":"8f98572963c52cc3cdc82c73a20b409d2efee8f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice/git/trees/8f98572963c52cc3cdc82c73a20b409d2efee8f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice/git/commits/4aa470d45e39fcd532d1819b297dc75b8b8c18a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53010592?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ztng123","id":53010592,"login":"ztng123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDEwNTky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ztng123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrservice/commit/4aa470d45e39fcd532d1819b297dc75b8b8c