r}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commit/839dc5e10696090035b7cce65ca95ddc8c574e83","node_id":"C_kwDOOVvAI9oAKDgzOWRjNWUxMDY5NjA5MDAzNWI3Y2NlNjVjYTk1ZGRjOGM1NzRlODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commit/7432292f32f847e4ee997b3899f2421c4288c1da","sha":"7432292f32f847e4ee997b3899f2421c4288c1da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commits/7432292f32f847e4ee997b3899f2421c4288c1da"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commit/5a9436c4623628a7958a62d59e6103d3902b1ac7","sha":"5a9436c4623628a7958a62d59e6103d3902b1ac7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commits/5a9436c4623628a7958a62d59e6103d3902b1ac7"}],"sha":"839dc5e10696090035b7cce65ca95ddc8c574e83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commits/839dc5e10696090035b7cce65ca95ddc8c574e83"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53090606?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andre9148","id":53090606,"login":"andre9148","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDkwNjA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commits/5a9436c4623628a7958a62d59e6103d3902b1ac7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:19:12Z","email":"andremorishita@yahoo.com.br","name":"Andre MG"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:19:12Z","email":"andremorishita@yahoo.com.br","name":"Andre MG"},"message":"fix: mostra o motivo da recusa e recarrega a grade apos erro (OLC-1070)\n\n- A recusa da gravacao chega ao paciente: a tela exibe o `message` da rota\n  (\"Este horario nao esta mais disponivel...\", bloqueio, conflito) em vez de\n  `AxiosError: Request failed with status code 400`.\n- Depois de qualquer erro a grade e'' recarregada, e na recusa (400) o horario\n  escolhido e'' descartado e o paciente volta ao passo \"Agendamento\". Com o limite\n  por dia a grade muda quando outro paciente agenda ou cancela, e a tela antiga\n  continuaria oferecendo o horario que a rota acabou de recusar.\n- A carga do `one-time-token` fica num so'' lugar (`loadOneTimeToken`), usado na\n  abertura, apos o sucesso e apos o erro.\n- Sai o `console.log(\"PERIOD D\")` do `getSlots`, que rodava dezenas de vezes por\n  render no console do site do cliente.\n- Condicao do corte explicita sobre `null` (`maxSlotsPerDay != null && > 0`).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"25ce60625c041d3ae3083c826e6dbcfad250afff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/git/trees/25ce60625c041d3ae3083c826e6dbcfad250afff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/git/commits/5a9436c4623628a7958a62d59e6103d3902b1ac7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53090606?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andre9148","id":53090606,"login":"andre9148","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDkwNjA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commit/5a9436c4623628a7958a62d59e6103d3902b1ac7","node_id":"C_kwDOOVvAI9oAKDVhOTQzNmM0NjIzNjI4YTc5NThhNjJkNTllNjEwM2QzOTAyYjFhYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commit/6fb86370a8ac8eb589b1d68f47189a730fd35056","sha":"6fb86370a8ac8eb589b1d68f47189a730fd35056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commits/6fb86370a8ac8eb589b1d68f47189a730fd35056"}],"sha":"5a9436c4623628a7958a62d59e6103d3902b1ac7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commits/5a9436c4623628a7958a62d59e6103d3902b1ac7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53090606?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andre9148","id":53090606,"login":"andre9148","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDkwNjA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commits/6fb86370a8ac8eb589b1d68f47189a730fd35056/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:15:52Z","email":"andremorishita@yahoo.com.br","name":"Andre MG"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:15:52Z","email":"andremorishita@yahoo.com.br","name":"Andre MG"},"message":"fix: horario oferecido tem de caber inteiro no expediente (OLC-1070)\n\nO `getSlots` aceitava todo horario que COMECASSE antes do fim do expediente\n(`moving < end`), mas a gravacao (`CreateAppointment` -> `slots_livres` no\nbackend) so'' conta o horario que CABE inteiro (`slot_inicio + passo <= fim`).\n\nCom o limite por dia ligado as duas grades tem de ser identicas, senao a tela\noferece o que a rota recusa: expediente ate 12:00, procedimento de 45min, dia\nquase cheio -> a tela mostra 11:45 entre os N primeiros e a gravacao responde\n\"Este horario nao esta mais disponivel\".\n\nVale para toda clinica, com ou sem o limite: o ultimo horario que invadia o fim\ndo expediente deixa de aparecer. Quando a duracao divide o expediente certinho\nnada muda.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c3b4ab416a6150ea471f44a112c786047ebf586","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/git/trees/0c3b4ab416a6150ea471f44a112c786047ebf586"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/git/commits/6fb86370a8ac8eb589b1d68f47189a730fd35056","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53090606?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andre9148","id":53090606,"login":"andre9148","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDkwNjA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commit/6fb86370a8ac8eb589b1d68f47189a730fd35056","node_id":"C_kwDOOVvAI9oAKDZmYjg2MzcwYThhYzhlYjU4OWIxZDY4ZjQ3MTg5YTczMGZkMzUwNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commit/fd6519c0c58186439aa1ce90b4ecffe4633f6960","sha":"fd6519c0c58186439aa1ce90b4ecffe4633f6960","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commits/fd6519c0c58186439aa1ce90b4ecffe4633f6960"}],"sha":"6fb86370a8ac8eb589b1d68f47189a730fd35056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commits/6fb86370a8ac8eb589b1d68f47189a730fd35056"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53090606?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andre9148","id":53090606,"login":"andre9148","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDkwNjA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commits/fd6519c0c58186439aa1ce90b4ecffe4633f6960/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T11:04:47Z","email":"andremorishita@yahoo.com.br","name":"Andre MG"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T22:39:17Z","email":"andremorishita@yahoo.com.br","name":"Andre MG"},"message":"feat: limita horarios oferecidos por dia (OLC-1070)\n\nA Clinica Concon pediu que o autoagendamento mostre apenas os N primeiros\nhorarios LIVRES de cada dia. Sem isso o paciente se marca em horario distante\ndo ultimo agendado (ultimo as 08:00, o proximo se marca as 15:00) e o medico\nfica ocioso no meio.\n\nO numero vem do backend, no campo aditivo `max_slots_per_day` do\n`one-time-token`, ligado por clinica. Ausente/null/<=0 = sem limite: a clinica\nque nao configurou o recurso continua vendo a grade inteira, e como o bundle e''\nservido pelo unpkg SEM pin de versao, isso vale para todos os ~15 clientes que\nrecebem esta versao sem terem pedido nada.\n\nO corte e'' o ULTIMO passo do `getSlots`, sobre a lista ja filtrada -- sao os N\nprimeiros livres, nao os N primeiros da grade. Cortar antes de remover os\nocupados ofereceria horario indisponivel.\n\nAqui, e nao so no backend, porque a contagem depende da duracao do procedimento\nque o paciente escolheu (`procedure.time`), e o `one-time-token` responde ANTES\ndessa escolha -- de la so da'' para delimitar uma janela de tempo, que rende\n`L / duracao` slots. Com o corte no front sao sempre N, qualquer duracao.\n\nO backend mantem o corte por tempo como rede de protecao para quem carregar um\nbundle antigo do cache do unpkg: nesse caso a tela mostra ~N em vez da grade\ninteira -- degrada, nao regride.\n\n`App.tsx` guarda o valor nos DOIS pontos que leem o payload: a carga inicial e o\nrefetch de depois de agendar. Sem o segundo, a tela voltaria a grade inteira\nassim que o paciente marcasse o primeiro horario.\n\nVerificado na tela, contra o backend local (medico com procedimentos de 15 e\n60min na mesma clinica): 60min -> 08:00 e 09:00; 15min -> 08:00 e 08:15;\nparametro desligado -> grade inteira. `tsc -b` limpo e `eslint` sem problema\nnovo (os 6 existentes ja estavam na `main`).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NLDYQvtaZq15BqbQTbxkUU","tree":{"sha":"41e672baa825716876a95abc39b1fd106320d9c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/git/trees/41e672baa825716876a95abc39b1fd106320d9c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/git/commits/fd6519c0c58186439aa1ce90b4ecffe4633f6960","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53090606?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andre9148","id":53090606,"login":"andre9148","n