tps://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commits/3f723d14a100170177dad1bcca425bbb70bf94a4"}],"sha":"7432292f32f847e4ee997b3899f2421c4288c1da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commits/7432292f32f847e4ee997b3899f2421c4288c1da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53090606?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andre9148","id":53090606,"login":"andre9148","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDkwNjA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/commits/3f723d14a100170177dad1bcca425bbb70bf94a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T22:38:25Z","email":"andremorishita@yahoo.com.br","name":"Andre MG"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T22:38:25Z","email":"andremorishita@yahoo.com.br","name":"Andre MG"},"message":"chore: versiona o .env.production com os valores que ja'' estao no bundle publicado\n\nAte'' agora nenhum `.env` jamais foi versionado neste repo (so'' o `.env.example`, com as\nchaves vazias). Consequencia: o bundle publicado carrega o `.env` da maquina de quem\nrodou o build -- hoje no ar estao `localhost:8080`, a api_key b3a22879 e doctor/clinic\n1431/24, de jul/2025, e esses valores nao existiam em lugar nenhum do repositorio. A\nunica copia era o proprio artefato no npm, de onde foram extraidos.\n\nSem isto, o proximo `npm publish` (a 0.0.24, do OLC-1070) trocaria silenciosamente esses\nvalores pelos do `.env` de quem publicasse.\n\n`vite build` roda em mode=production e da'' prioridade ao `.env.production` sobre o `.env`,\nque fica valendo so'' no `npm run dev`. Conferido: com este arquivo, o build reproduz os\ncinco artefatos da 0.0.23 publicada BYTE A BYTE (iife, esm, cjs e os dois CSS), mesmo com\num `.env` pessoal presente apontando para outro medico/clinica.\n\nOs valores sao fallback: `App.tsx` sobrescreve o CONFIG com os atributos do web component\ne todo HTML de cliente passa todos eles. Ficam registrados aqui como o que o artefato\ncontem hoje, nao como configuracao desejavel -- o `localhost:8080` de fallback e a api_key\nno bundle publico seguem como divida, a ser tratada trocando o default por exigir o\natributo (muda o artefato dos ~15 clientes, entao nao entra junto).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea7d97a1276ca5e76869e2797a279d3b3ae6b5cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/git/trees/ea7d97a1276ca5e76869e2797a279d3b3ae6b5cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/online-clinic-gestao/agenda-desacoplada/git/commits/3f723d14a100170177dad1bcca425bbb70bf94a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53090606?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andre9148/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andre9148","id":53090606,"login":"andre9148","node