efore pip install on Linux\r\n- Update .dockerignore: exclude .git/, frontend/node_modules/, frontend/.next/\r\n- Add docs/evidence/docker_smoke_test.md: build logs, container smoke tests,\r\n  docker compose ps showing both services healthy, scope boundary table\r\n\r\ndocker compose build exit code 0; both images verified:\r\n  automl-backend:local 17.6 GB (183 packages including torch 2.6.0)\r\n  automl-frontend:local 3.88 GB (Next.js 15.2.1 production bundle)\r\n\r\ndocker compose up -d exit code 0; automl-backend (healthy), automl-frontend up.\r\nStandalone container tests: backend HTTP 200 JSON, frontend HTTP 200 62 KB HTML.\r\npytest: 57 passed, 3 skipped.","tree":{"sha":"1530055948a7445aebd269e00045eaf944fa94a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IjazKakkodDS/ai-automl-app/git/trees/1530055948a7445aebd269e00045eaf944fa94a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IjazKakkodDS/ai-automl-app/git/commits/c6d41c9426c431c5ead48417f91d092bb9bc41a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150619051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IjazKakkodDS","id":150619051,"login":"IjazKakkodDS","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpDqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.g