com","name":"IjazKakkodDS"},"message":"Extend AutoML benchmark evidence with real dataset timing\r\n\r\nAdd real-dataset benchmark section to benchmark/run_benchmark.py that\r\nmeasures preprocessing, EDA, and LogisticRegression model training on\r\nthe tracked Telco Customer Churn dataset (7,043 rows, 21 columns).\r\n\r\nKey results (local in-process, N=3-5):\r\n- Preprocessing (Telco 7043 rows): P50=231ms (vs 12.5ms at 200 rows)\r\n- EDA (Telco, max_numeric_cols=3): P50=94,229ms (94 seconds per call)\r\n- Model training LogisticRegression (Telco, 7032 rows): P50=818ms\r\n\r\nAll three real-dataset endpoints succeeded (5/5, 3/3, 3/3).\r\nSynthetic 200-row baseline preserved unchanged.\r\n\r\nAlso adds model_reports/ to the artifact snapshot so future runs\r\nauto-clean training report CSVs. Updates benchmark_report.md with\r\nfull scalability analysis and updated interpretation.","tree":{"sha":"1c457308029f3f4c772f64097cc7e90dbba3c8ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IjazKakkodDS/ai-automl-app/git/trees/1c457308029f3f4c772f64097cc7e90dbba3c8ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IjazKakkodDS/ai-automl-app/git/commits/bb8c1a4b7152bec12772cae6307a6fbeb44694c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150619051?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IjazKakkodDS","id":150619051,"login":"IjazKakkodDS","node_id":"U_kgDOCPpDqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodDS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IjazKakkodD