ed23e5ca3098b36848b7d40f9bedd55c16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/a3c4ffed23e5ca3098b36848b7d40f9bedd55c16"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/4d2177ac79977ceae3c06e571ea6f2a9ce990fc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T08:54:46Z","email":"lixy115@lenovo.com","name":"lixy115"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T08:54:46Z","email":"lixy115@lenovo.com","name":"lixy115"},"message":"Add StockHoldings data; refactor test init\n\nRefactor Python/Test/init.py into a small demo BankAccount module: introduce InsufficientFundsError, a log_transaction decorator, deposit/withdraw methods and a main() runner. Remove an old generated report under reports/. Add many StockHoldings assets (JSON metrics and latest refresh data for multiple tickers, summaries, payout info, PDFs, snippet text files, tmp refresh scripts, and __pycache__ pyc files). Add/modify multiple stocks/reports markdown files and an actionLog entry, and add a uat-openapi header file. Overall this commit refreshes stock holding data and replaces the simple test function with a reusable account example.","tree":{"sha":"d202477ed0c3fa41b611c8a47dc4f56294298764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/git/trees/d202477ed0c3fa41b611c8a47dc4f56294298764"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/git/commits/4d2177ac79977ceae3c06e571ea6f2a9ce990fc4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commit/4d2177ac79977ceae3c06e571ea6f2a9ce990fc4","node_id":"C_kwDOOWksu9oAKDRkMjE3N2FjNzk5NzdjZWFlM2MwNmU1NzFlYTZmMmE5Y2U5OTBmYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commit/bdf72775d7dd71dc53468352e8b21ebaa300ab9b","sha":"bdf72775d7dd71dc53468352e8b21ebaa300ab9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/bdf72775d7dd71dc53468352e8b21ebaa300ab9b"}],"sha":"4d2177ac79977ceae3c06e571ea6f2a9ce990fc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/4d2177ac79977ceae3c06e571ea6f2a9ce990fc4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/bdf72775d7dd71dc53468352e8b21ebaa300ab9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-26T05:42:06Z","email":"lixy115@lenovo.com","name":"lixy115"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-26T05:42:06Z","email":"lixy115@lenovo.com","name":"lixy115"},"message":"Add complete investment decision reports for 美的集团 and 华润三九\n\n- Created a detailed investment decision report for 美的集团 (000333) outlining the company''s financial health, growth potential, and valuation analysis as of March 25, 2026.\n- Developed a comprehensive investment decision report for 华润三九 (000999) summarizing the company''s performance, market position, and future outlook as of March 26, 2026.","tree":{"sha":"49f92bcf9da79eaaa4a22647871b4dc18a1e1149","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/git/trees/49f92bcf9da79eaaa4a22647871b4dc18a1e1149"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/git/commits/bdf72775d7dd71dc53468352e8b21ebaa300ab9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commit/bdf72775d7dd71dc53468352e8b21ebaa300ab9b","node_id":"C_kwDOOWksu9oAKGJkZjcyNzc1ZDdkZDcxZGM1MzQ2ODM1MmU4YjIxZWJhYTMwMGFiOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commit/6112429588d433db96fbc66bebd0b946407986f2","sha":"6112429588d433db96fbc66bebd0b946407986f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/6112429588d433db96fbc66bebd0b946407986f2"}],"sha":"bdf72775d7dd71dc53468352e8b21ebaa300ab9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/bdf72775d7dd71dc53468352e8b21ebaa300ab9b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/6112429588d433db96fbc66bebd0b946407986f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T09:52:57Z","email":"lixy115@lenovo.com","name":"lixy115"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T09:52:57Z","email":"lixy115@lenovo.com","name":"lixy115"},"message":"Add A-share growth system design and update agents\n\nAdd .github/a-share-growth-system-design.md describing the A‑share growth stock workflow (skills, agents, prompts, references) and maintenance rules. Update .github/agents/* and prompts to align agents with a Value Investing 3.0 + Fisher growth framework, clarify routing/output contracts, streamline tool scopes (read/search/web/agent), and refine thresholds/labels for hard‑filter, fundamental and valuation layers. Add a new portfolio-action agent and numerous generated reports and stock notes under reports/ and stocks/.","tree":{"sha":"648e5d55a55e91d605208020de34836f628f16f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/git/trees/648e5d55a55e91d605208020de34836f628f16f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/git/commits/6112429588d433db96fbc66bebd0b946407986f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commit/6112429588d433db96fbc66bebd0b946407986f2","node_id":"C_kwDOOWksu9oAKDYxMTI0Mjk1ODhkNDMzZGI5NmZiYzY2YmViZDBiOTQ2NDA3OTg2ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commit/371b656cf5388f833428adc74f24b90946b81e87","sha":"371b656cf5388f833428adc74f24b90946b81e87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/371b656cf5388f833428adc74f24b90946b81e87"}],"sha":"6112429588d433db96fbc66bebd0b946407986f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/6112429588d433db96fbc66bebd0b946407986f2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/371b656cf5388f833428adc74f24b90946b81e87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T09:43:36Z","email":"lixy115@lenovo.com","name":"lixy115"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T09:43:36Z","email":"lixy115@lenovo.com","name":"lixy115"},"message":"Add Value Investing 3.0 agents and stock tools\n\nIntroduce a Value Investing 3.0 upgrade: add a new .github/agents/README and update multiple A‑share agent definitions to enforce standardized data extraction/cleaning, DCF three‑scenario outputs (Fair Value / Buy Zone / Strong Buy Zone), and a 85/15 basic/valuation scoring framework. Adjust agent behaviors (many set as internal), expand tooling lists and output templates, and add data‑quality rules (normalized FCF, anomaly handling, Revenue/FCF CAGR, Debt safety). Also add copilot prompts and instructions, new stock holdings utilities (import_holdings_batch.py, update_headers_to_cn.py and helper pyc), analysis/enhancement docs, and several generated reports/results; update .gitignore accordingly.","tree":{"sha":"bd3d528b8a62454d34f6f51cd77ee92b96983a85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/git/trees/bd3d528b8a62454d34f6f51cd77ee92b96983a85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/git/commits/371b656cf5388f833428adc74f24b90946b81e87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commit/371b656cf5388f833428adc74f24b90946b81e87","node_id":"C_kwDOOWksu9oAKDM3MWI2NTZjZjUzODhmODMzNDI4YWRjNzRmMjRiOTA5NDZiODFlODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commit/677d3c4c5ac475e3f29fd1d66d31a4d310696a09","sha":"677d3c4c5ac475e3f29fd1d66d31a4d310696a09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/677d3c4c5ac475e3f29fd1d66d31a4d310696a09"}],"sha":"371b656cf5388f833428adc74f24b90946b81e87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/371b656cf5388f833428adc74f24b90946b81e87"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/677d3c4c5ac475e3f29fd1d66d31a4d310696a09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T09:28:11Z","email":"lixy115@lenovo.com","name":"lixy115"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T09:28:11Z","email":"lixy115@lenovo.com","name":"lixy115"},"message":"feat: Add comprehensive investment workflow and exception handling documentation\n\n- Introduced new markdown files for exception checks, routing, and industry scope to enhance investment decision-making processes.\n- Developed a structured A-share investment workflow with clear stages: threshold assessment, fundamental analysis, and valuation.\n- Implemented completion checks to ensure thorough analysis at each stage.\n- Created a master routing map to guide users through the investment analysis process.\n- Added a new Python script for financial calculations related to investment analysis.\n- Established a detailed investment analysis agent prompt to standardize evaluations based on value investing principles.\n- Included advanced analysis capabilities focusing on valuation, financial quality, business model, and risk assessment.","tree":{"sha":"7902856bebf4fd290896a2651d291699416f7387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/git/trees/7902856bebf4fd290896a2651d291699416f7387"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/git/commits/677d3c4c5ac475e3f29fd1d66d31a4d310696a09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commit/677d3c4c5ac475e3f29fd1d66d31a4d310696a09","node_id":"C_kwDOOWksu9oAKDY3N2QzYzRjNWFjNDc1ZTNmMjlmZDFkNjZkMzFhNGQzMTA2OTZhMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commit/5bf8a0fe1a950219ebd76fa8fb16e6afb5ebf588","sha":"5bf8a0fe1a950219ebd76fa8fb16e6afb5ebf588","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/5bf8a0fe1a950219ebd76fa8fb16e6afb5ebf588"}],"sha":"677d3c4c5ac475e3f29fd1d66d31a4d310696a09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/677d3c4c5ac475e3f29fd1d66d31a4d310696a09"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/commits/5bf8a0fe1a950219ebd76fa8fb16e6afb5ebf588/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T09:42:13Z","email":"lixy115@lenovo.com","name":"lixy115"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T09:42:13Z","email":"lixy115@lenovo.com","name":"lixy115"},"message":"Add i18n routing, dictionaries, and locale proxy\n\nIntroduce basic internationalization: add JSON dictionaries (en, zh, ja, ko) and a dictionaries index with getDictionary, locales and defaultLocale. Add a localized Home page and a client SwitchI18n component to change language in the UI. Implement locale-aware proxy/middleware that uses Negotiator and @formatjs/intl-localematcher to redirect non-prefixed routes to a language-prefixed path based on Accept-Language; add a simple CORS helper. Update tsconfig with @dict path alias and comment out unused Vue scripts in layout. Add negotiator and formatjs dependencies/types in package.json and pnpm lock. Minor tweak to the login API route (commented debug) and other small formatting/cleanup changes.","tree":{"sha":"0b230715b0042e7d4133545bfae64f346dafcd16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/git/trees/0b230715b0042e7d4133545bfae64f346dafcd16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zuishuailxy/KnowledgeBase/git/commits/5bf8a0fe1a950219ebd76fa8fb16e6afb5ebf588","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.c